  "id": "5e74b593-8acc-55d4-b36e-2f0b21cfb247",
  "slug": "easy-doner-style-gyros-recipe-11948932",
  "name": "Easy Doner-Style Gyros",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "For these easy doner-style gyros, ground chicken is seasoned with warming spices to achieve bold flavor, then baked in parchment until tender with crispy edges, and served in a pita with bright tzatziki sauce, tomatoes, cucumbers, red onion, and parsley.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Mix together ground chicken, onion, oil, paprika, cumin, oregano, pepper, coriander, 2 teaspoons salt, 2 teaspoons grated garlic, and 1/4 cup yogurt in a large bowl until well combined and smooth."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Divide meat mixture among 3 rectangular sheets of parchment paper (about 1 1/3 cups per sheet). Use a flexible spatula to spread meat all the way to the edges in a very thin layer, covering the sheet of parchment paper."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Starting with shorter end of the paper, fold meat-covered parchment several times in about 1 1/2-inch folds. Place folded, filled parchment on a large rimmed baking sheet."
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cooked through, 20 to 25 minutes, draining off some of the accumulated fat and juices halfway through."
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "text": "Meanwhile, place grated cucumber in a fine mesh strainer set over a medium bowl. Toss with 1/4 teaspoon of the salt and let sit for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally. Press accumulated juices through strainer. Stir together drained cucumber, dill, 1 tablespoon of the lemon juice, remaining 3/4 cup yogurt, 1/4 teaspoon salt, and 1/4 teaspoon grated garlic in a bowl; set tzatziki sauce aside."
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "text": "Unravel meat from paper, break into large pieces, and return to baking sheet. Toss with remaining 2 tablespoons lemon juice."
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "text": "Serve meat on warm pita with tzatziki sauce, red onion, tomato, cucumber, and parsley. Serve with French fries, if desired. Recipe developed by Isabell Easter"
    }
  ],
  "servings": 8,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 20,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 30,
